# THE ARC ERA — the DEC-ARC campaign env re-pointed at the ARC project (2026-09-15; the PI: "all further ARC project content and
# compute goes there"). = tools/campaign_decarc.env (the DEC-ARC night, Plan_2026-09-10_DEC-ARC_Build.md) with ONLY the project,
# bucket, node name, labels and zones changed; every science knob is copied unchanged. NOT ACTIVE: launch only on the PI's go
# (spend envelope + a canary first; tools/HANDOFF.md "THE ARC PROJECT"). Activate by copying to tools/campaign.env at launch.
# A SHARED lab project, SPOT ONLY (the PI 2026-09-15): our nodes are named qhrrn2-* and labeled (the launchd watchdog lists and
# deletes ONLY qhrrn2-* nodes there; pod.sh and dispatcher.py refuse a non-prefixed name, a missing POD_LABELS and --on-demand);
# no IAM changes; never another member's node, bucket or spend. Identity (the PI: "git ignore the credential related details"):
# the account, the project id and the gcloud configuration name come from the git-ignored tools/.gcp_local.env.
# THE NIGHT'S KNOBS (2026-09-15; Plan_2026-09-10_DEC-ARC_Build §12 = the Sudoku lessons folded in; each is the registration draft's
# recommendation and the PI's to change before launch):
#   the fit protocol (the PI's decision, pending since the pilot): DA_FIT_T=1 (one map application per fit step = every cell's
#     training form; the deployed 16-pass fit is 624 h/arm) DA_FIT_STEPS=150 (retention needs a fitted code; 50 = weaker codes);
#     the battery V2: DA_VIEWS_VH=2 DA_ARC1_VIEWS=1 DA_K_VH=16 DA_ARC1_K=4; DA_COST_BUDGET_H=6 (the cost probe refuses a battery
#     projecting above it; the CHAIN-COST-ABORT marker then stands every rerun down and pod.sh tears the node down);
#   the evaluation start (the width-192 CPU lens): DA_EVAL_START=fieldfix (the S10-invariant seeded draw from the training
#     family the monitor selects on and the cold rows use) DA_START_ROWS=buffers,symfix,rifix (the other starts as descriptive
#     rows of the same fitted code, no re-fit);
#   the selection (the Night A / paper-final lessons on a ~150-query monitor): DA_SEL_KEY3=val_pix_ema (the EMA pixel accuracy
#     breaks the exact-count ties the raw monitor leaves) DA_EXT_PLATEAU_PP=0.02 (the extension keys on the plateau's end, not
#     the argmax: any grid within 2 pp of the maximum inside the last 4k extends the arm once);
#   the instruments: DA_MON96=1 (the trained monitor tasks' held-out queries with their trained codes, no fit = the direct
#     retention row R-DA-5b) DA_BRIDGE=1 (N0 on val-hard at its deployed 6-pass fit, k 0 = the protocol bridge, labeled)
#     DA_TRACE_FUSED=1 (the trace's per-step stats in one device call; the cost probe cross-checks it on the chip and the
#     chain falls back to the eager path on a mismatch).
source tools/gcp_local.sh || return 2 2>/dev/null || exit 2
export CLOUDSDK_ACTIVE_CONFIG_NAME=$ARC_GCLOUD_CONFIG   # a gcloud configuration pointing at the ARC project (not the active default)
export QHRRN_GCP_PROJECT=$ARC_PROJECT                   # the dispatcher's identity guard
PROJECT=$ARC_PROJECT                                     # pod.sh / ops_snapshot.sh / dms_keeper.sh / plant_guard.sh
POD=qhrrn2-arc-pod
POD_LABELS=program=qhrrn2,owner=aakash,purpose=arc
ZONES="us-east1-d us-east5-b us-east5-a us-central1-a us-central1-b us-central1-c us-west1-c us-south1-a asia-south1-c"   # the project's v6e zones, US first, Mumbai last (europe-west4-a also offers v6e; not in the rotation without the PI)
ACCEL=v6e-8
ACCEL_LIST="v6e-8"
BIG_MAX_STRIKES=99
R_TAG=decarc
R_D=160
R_STEPS=30000
ARMS="D0 D1 D2 N0"
CHAIN_SCRIPT=tools/chain_decarc.sh
CHAIN_EXTRA_ENV="SELF_TEARDOWN=0 C1_WAIT_PASSES=600 RIDER=0 GCS=gs://qhrrn2-arc/decarc GCS_SETS=gs://qhrrn2-arc/sets GCS_CHAMP_SETS=gs://qhrrn2-arc/sets DA_FIT_T=1 DA_FIT_STEPS=150 DA_VIEWS_VH=2 DA_ARC1_VIEWS=1 DA_K_VH=16 DA_ARC1_K=4 DA_COST_BUDGET_H=6 DA_EVAL_START=fieldfix DA_START_ROWS=buffers,symfix,rifix DA_SEL_KEY3=val_pix_ema DA_EXT_PLATEAU_PP=0.02 DA_MON96=1 DA_BRIDGE=1 DA_TRACE_FUSED=1"
WALL=30600
SENTINEL=CHAIN-DECARC-COMPLETE
GCS=gs://qhrrn2-arc/decarc
FINAL_OBJ=decarc_final.tgz
CANARY_CKPT=runs/pretrain6_d24/ckpt_latest.pkl
